e 28 instead of 29) and `4.35` (434 instead of 435). Every total built on those prices was a cent short per unit.\n\n**Fix:** `to_cents` now converts the amount with `Decimal(str(amount))`, multiplies by 100, and rounds half-up to a whole cent. `str()` gives the shortest exact form (`'19.99'`), so the float error never reaches the cent value. If a price has a fraction of a cent, it now rounds instead of being cut off. Negative fractions round away from zero (`-0.005` becomes `-1`); nothing in the tests uses negative prices.\n\n**To run the tests:** the installed `pytest` is broken (it can't find its own `_pytest` module). I ran them with `uvx pytest -o pythonpath=.`, because the repo has no setting that puts `ledger` on the import path.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 0, "replies_ok": 8, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 120658, "requests_cache_write": 42124, "requests_cost_usd": 0.2680836, "requests_count": 8, "requests_input_uncached": 18, "requests_output": 1663, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-multistep:claude-opus-5-5:trial4", "run_seed": 20261014, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 7, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-12T23:42:51.468908+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 22.838, "t_checker_s": 0.383, "t_env_setup_s": 0.002, "task": "trig-omp-multistep", "task_calls": 0, "timeout_s": 360, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1681, "tokens_cache_read": 120658, "tokens_cache_write": 42124, "tokens_fresh": 1681, "tokens_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_main_cache_read": 120658, "tokens_main_cache_write": 42124, "tokens_main_calls": 8, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_main_output": 1663, "tokens_output": 1663, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 120658, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 42124, "tokens_pr